{"version":1,"content":"<p>男團MATCH成員何家銘（Tomy），經歷過夾Band、參加真人選秀騷、回到幕後擔任監製、編曲、作曲，到現時單飛發展音樂事業。</p><p>在音樂路上跌跌碰碰的了13年的他，日前（13日）終於首次以個人身份假西九文化區舉行「《LIFE IS CHAOS》</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:18:21.489117+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:38.181754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:11:38.181754+00:00","content_hash":"25da4e1aa1dd985be03fd3bed4f4e11f18584669160d49d573d94a354048330b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}